<section class="aq-section aq-section--alt aq-trace-lines-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">An example: two requirements traced to their tests</h2></header><div class="aq-trace-lines-wrap has-tile"><div class="aq-trace-lines" style="--k:2;--n:4"><div class="aq-trace-lines__docs" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-trace-lines__dh" style="grid-row:1">Document</span><span class="aq-trace-lines__doc" style="grid-row:2"><span class="aq-trace-lines__dn">01</span>URS compliance matrix</span><span class="aq-trace-lines__doc" style="grid-row:3"><span class="aq-trace-lines__dn">02</span>Basis of design</span><span class="aq-trace-lines__doc" style="grid-row:4"><span class="aq-trace-lines__dn">03</span>Functional specification</span><span class="aq-trace-lines__doc" style="grid-row:5"><span class="aq-trace-lines__dn">04</span>Verification</span></div><div class="aq-trace-lines__line" data-line="0" style="--col:2"><div class="aq-trace-lines__head" style="grid-row:1"><span class="aq-trace-lines__code">URS-012</span><h3 class="aq-trace-lines__req">conductivity ≤ 1.3 <span class="aq-unit">µ</span>S/cm @ 25 °C</h3></div><ol class="aq-trace-lines__stops" role="list"><li class="aq-trace-lines__st" style="grid-row:2"><span class="aq-trace-lines__k">URS compliance matrix</span><p class="aq-trace-lines__p"><span class="aq-trace-lines__met">Met</span> Outlet designed to <span class="aq-ph">[outlet conductivity guarantee, <span class="aq-unit">µ</span>S/cm @ 25 °C]</span>; return monitored.</p></li><li class="aq-trace-lines__st" style="grid-row:3"><span class="aq-trace-lines__k">Basis of design</span><p class="aq-trace-lines__p">Reverse osmosis and electrodeionization, passes set by your feed water analysis</p></li><li class="aq-trace-lines__st" style="grid-row:4"><span class="aq-trace-lines__k">Functional specification</span><p class="aq-trace-lines__p">Water above the divert setpoint goes to drain until conductivity recovers</p></li><li cla